# --- Kernel ownership boundary -------------------------------------------
#
# kernel/ owns the G1-G10 gate schemas, run-record validation, and
# gate-authority semantics; roster/ owns the role catalog, routing, and
# policy. Before the monorepo merge that split was enforced by the two
# living in separate repositories with separate release cadences. Merging
# removed that guarantee, so it is re-stated here and enforced by
# roster/orchestration/test/test_kernel_boundary.py.
#
# These entries are deliberately narrower than the catch-all above: a change
# under kernel/contracts/ alters what "approved" means for every project
# that has adopted the lifecycle, which is a different class of change from
# adding a role definition. Give it its own review, and split the reviewers
# here the moment more than one person maintains this repository.
